00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:29,760
Second one is how are holograms made.

119
00:12:29,880 --> 00:12:41,000
Well, geez, I'll tell you what, David, I mean uh uh we did cover this in the workshop, but maybe you just want me to answer the question on the air.

